# Save Game (Ctrl+S) under the name _cp_save in the test folder's saves folder, as
# tools/mp/autosave.ps1 does: the dialog's filename field, the name, OK. The driver removes
# saves\_cp_* before each case, so the dialog never finds the file there already. The dialog opens
# in the game folder's saves because the harness sets the game's save path there after the load
# (src/clickpass.cpp, set_save_path).
save Council.SAV
keys ^s
click 520 494
keys {END}{BACKSPACE 60}_cp_save
click 445 521
